{"unit_id":"OnesoftQwQ__dsh-one-memory#readme-1","repo":"OnesoftQwQ/dsh-one-memory","commit":"9910359d3f491e0407116e8d8c5df83f1f2a379d","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-one-memory README · dsh-one-memory：DeepSeek Harness 插件：一份**全局记忆** + 一组**键值记忆**，会话开始时注入全局记忆和所有 key 的目录；主 agent 的对话轮次归档进本地 SQLite，模型可以按 session id + turn 回放原始对话。\n\n- 全局记忆使用保留 key `@global`；\n- 键值记忆由模型通过工具手动创建、更新、删除；不做自动抽取、自动合并或自动过期；\n- 来源以 Markdown 内联引用写在记忆正文里：`[1](m-lq2x9d3f:12)`；插件**不解析**引用，模型读 id 后自己调用 `memory_recall`；\n- 会话 id 由插件统一生成（`m-...`），映射宿主的原生 session id；\n- 一轮对话 = 一个用户消息（或同轮 steering 消息）+ 该轮最终的 assistant 文本；工具调用、思维链、注入上下文都不归档。","source":"extracted","section":"dsh-one-memory"}
{"unit_id":"OnesoftQwQ__dsh-one-memory#readme-2","repo":"OnesoftQwQ/dsh-one-memory","commit":"9910359d3f491e0407116e8d8c5df83f1f2a379d","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-one-memory README · 存储：`~/.agents/one-memory/one-memory.db`（目录 0700、文件 0600、WAL）：\n\n```text\n~/.agents/one-memory/one-memory.db\n├── meta(key, value)                        # schema 版本、全局 revision\n├── memory_entry(...)                       # 全局 + 键值记忆\n├── memory_tombstone(...)                   # 增量注入用的删除记录","source":"extracted","section":"存储"}
{"unit_id":"OnesoftQwQ__dsh-one-memory#readme-3","repo":"OnesoftQwQ/dsh-one-memory","commit":"9910359d3f491e0407116e8d8c5df83f1f2a379d","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-one-memory README · 存储：- 与 [opencode-one-memory](../opencode-one-memory) 共用同一个库；\n- 首次启动会从旧位置 `~/.agent-memory/agent-memory.db` 复制一份（`VACUUM INTO`），并导入更早的 `~/.dsh/memory/memory.json`；\n- 运行时适配：Node 用 `node:sqlite`，Bun 用 `bun:sqlite`（见 `src/core/db.ts`），插件本体零运行时依赖。","source":"extracted","section":"存储"}
{"unit_id":"OnesoftQwQ__dsh-one-memory#readme-4","repo":"OnesoftQwQ/dsh-one-memory","commit":"9910359d3f491e0407116e8d8c5df83f1f2a379d","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-one-memory README · 工具：| 工具 | 作用 |\n| --- | --- |\n| `memory_get({ key? })` | 读一条记忆；不传 key 返回全局记忆 + 完整 key 目录 + 当前 session id / turn |\n| `memory_set({ key, value, description? })` | 创建/更新；`key = \"@global\"` 更新全局记忆 |\n| `memory_delete({ key })` | 删除；`@global` 清空全局记忆 |\n| `memory_recall({ session_id?, turn?, before?, after? })` | 从归档回放一轮；默认当前会话 + 最新一轮 |\n| `session_list({ query?, include_subagents?, offset?, limit? })` | 会话列表；每行给统一 id 和宿主 id |\n| `memory_search({ query, session_id?, max_sessions?, limit? })` | 搜归档（含 opencode 轮次），归档为空才回退到 DSH 的 FTS/字面扫描 |","source":"extracted","section":"工具"}
{"unit_id":"OnesoftQwQ__dsh-one-memory#readme-5","repo":"OnesoftQwQ/dsh-one-memory","commit":"9910359d3f491e0407116e8d8c5df83f1f2a379d","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-one-memory README · 安装：仓库已经带上 `lib/` 构建产物，所以两种方式都能直接装：\n\n**从 GitHub（Web 插件管理器）**\n\n```text\ngithub:OnesoftQwQ/dsh-one-memory\n```\n\n**从本地目录**\n\n```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/OnesoftQwQ/dsh-one-memory.git\n```\n\n然后在 DSH 的插件管理器里填这个绝对路径（profile 用 `link:` 指向它，不跑安装脚本，直接读 `lib/`）。\n\n修改源码后需要手动构建：\n\n```bash\nnpm install && npm run build\n```","source":"extracted","section":"安装"}
